    "markdown": "---\ntitle: describe\n---\n\n\n\n```python\ndescribe(df, variables=None, by='year', ref=None)\n```\n\nSummary statistics of a panel's variables, per ``by`` group (default: per year).\n\n## Parameters {.doc-section .doc-section-parameters}\n\n| Name      | Type         | Description                                                                                                                                                 | Default    |\n|-----------|--------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|------------|\n| df        | pd.DataFrame | A panel, e.g. from ``geo.load``                                                                                                                             | _required_ |\n| variables |              | A variable or list of them (default: every numeric variable)                                                                                                | `None`     |\n| by        | str \\| None  | A column to group by: ``\"year\"`` (default), ``None`` to pool all rows, or a group such as ``\"department\"`` (after ``geo.load(..., groups=[\"department\"])``) | `'year'`   |\n\n## Returns {.doc-section .doc-section-returns}\n\n| Name   | Type             | Description                                                                                                                                           |\n|--------|------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n|        | pandas.DataFrame | One row per variable (and group): ``variable``, ``label``, ``unit``, ``count``, ``mean``, ``std``, ``min``, ``p25``, ``median``, ``p75`` and ``max``. |\n\n## Example {.doc-section .doc-section-example}\n\n```python\n!pip install -q geo4bolivia\nimport geo4bolivia as geo\nimport plotly.express as px\n\ndf = geo.load(\"sdg06\", groups=[\"department\"])\ndisplay(geo.describe(df))                          # per period\ns = geo.describe(df, variables=\"index_sdg6\", by=\"department\")\npx.bar(s, x=\"department\", y=\"mean\", error_y=\"std\", labels={\"mean\": s[\"label\"][0]},\n       title=\"Clean water and sanitation index by department (both periods)\")\n```\n\n::: {.g4-example-links}\n[Open a blank Colab notebook to run it](https://colab.research.google.com/notebooks/empty.ipynb)\n:::\n\n\n::: {#6e56426a .cell execution_count=1}\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display}\n```{=html}\n<div>\n<style scoped>\n    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n        vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n        vertical-align: top;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe thead th {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n</style>\n<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n      <th></th>\n      <th>variable</th>\n      <th>label</th>\n      <th>unit</th>\n      <th>year</th>\n      <th>count</th>\n      <th>mean</th>\n      <th>std</th>\n      <th>min</th>\n      <th>p25</th>\n      <th>median</th>\n      <th>p75</th>\n      <th>max</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th>0</th>\n      <td>index_sdg6</td>\n      <td>Clean water and sanitation index (0-100)</td>\n      <td>index (0-100)</td>\n      <td>2012</td>\n      <td>343</td>\n      <td>26.248688</td>\n      <td>12.542797</td>\n      <td>0.0</td>\n      <td>18.65</td>\n      <td>25.5</td>\n      <td>33.40</td>\n      <td>76.9</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>1</th>\n      <td>index_sdg6</td>\n      <td>Clean water and sanitation index (0-100)</td>\n      <td>index (0-100)</td>\n      <td>2024</td>\n      <td>343</td>\n      <td>41.769096</td>\n      <td>12.678638</td>\n      <td>10.8</td>\n      <td>33.80</td>\n      <td>40.9</td>\n      <td>48.30</td>\n      <td>86.9</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>2</th>\n      <td>sdg6_1_cap</td>\n      <td>Drinking-water coverage (% of population)</td>\n      <td>% of population</td>\n      <td>2012</td>\n      <td>343</td>\n      <td>66.276093</td>\n      <td>21.268711</td>\n      <td>1.5</td>\n      <td>54.25</td>\n      <td>69.7</td>\n      <td>82.30</td>\n      <td>99.3</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>3</th>\n      <td>sdg6_1_cap</td>\n      <td>Drinking-water coverage (% of population)</td>\n      <td>% of population</td>\n      <td>2024</td>\n      <td>343</td>\n      <td>80.339942</td>\n      <td>14.609916</td>\n      <td>21.5</td>\n      <td>73.80</td>\n      <td>84.1</td>\n      <td>90.55</td>\n      <td>99.0</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>4</th>\n      <td>sdg6_2_cas</td>\n      <td>Sanitation coverage (% of population)</td>\n      <td>% of population</td>\n      <td>2012</td>\n      <td>343</td>\n      <td>20.335860</td>\n      <td>12.438030</td>\n      <td>0.3</td>\n      <td>10.85</td>\n      <td>18.6</td>\n      <td>28.00</td>\n      <td>61.1</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>5</th>\n      <td>sdg6_2_cas</td>\n      <td>Sanitation coverage (% of population)</td>\n      <td>% of population</td>\n      <td>2024</td>\n      <td>343</td>\n      <td>46.281924</td>\n      <td>17.859282</td>\n      <td>4.8</td>\n      <td>33.00</td>\n      <td>45.4</td>\n      <td>59.25</td>\n      <td>87.2</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>6</th>\n      <td>sdg6_3_tar</td>\n      <td>Wastewater treated (%)</td>\n      <td>% of wastewater</td>\n      <td>2012</td>\n      <td>343</td>\n      <td>3.423907</td>\n      <td>18.610863</td>\n      <td>0.0</td>\n      <td>0.00</td>\n      <td>0.0</td>\n      <td>0.00</td>\n      <td>170.5</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>7</th>\n      <td>sdg6_3_tar</td>\n      <td>Wastewater treated (%)</td>\n      <td>% of wastewater</td>\n      <td>2024</td>\n      <td>343</td>\n      <td>6.962099</td>\n      <td>31.252333</td>\n      <td>0.0</td>\n      <td>0.00</td>\n      <td>0.0</td>\n      <td>0.00</td>\n      <td>401.4</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n```\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display}\n```{=html}\n<div style=\"height:525px; width:100%;\">            <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/3.2.2/es5/tex-svg.min.js\"></script><script>if (window.MathJax && window.MathJax.Hub && window.MathJax.Hub.Config) {window.MathJax.Hub.Config({SVG: {font: \"STIX-Web\"}});}</script>                <script>window.PlotlyConfig = {MathJaxConfig: 'local'};</script>\n        <script charset=\"utf-8\" src=\"https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-4.1.1.min.js\" integrity=\"sha256-O24V1F27f8pb0glCkelh3cVHLNiHAJ5gCaVtq2aNch8=\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>                <div id=\"e5001e0c-4bf4-42a4-8dca-58214a885d89\" class=\"plotly-graph-div\" style=\"height:100%; width:100%;\"></div>            <script>                window.PLOTLYENV=window.PLOTLYENV || {};                                if (document.getElementById(\"e5001e0c-4bf4-42a4-8dca-58214a885d89\")) {                    Plotly.newPlot(                        \"e5001e0c-4bf4-42a4-8dca-58214a885d89\",                        [{\"error_y\":{\"array\":{\"dtype\":\"f8\",\"bdata\":\"rJ1sgGNqLECiLc3z5aoqQFcQ4DheWCxAyE+cBmxMKEBurxe+Lr0tQA+PighEuCVAC0tc4I0XJkBwcFFGpo8tQCAYXTqCojBA\"}},\"hovertemplate\":\"department=%{x}\\u003cbr\\u003eClean water and sanitation index (0-100)=%{y}\\u003cextra\\u003e\\u003c\\u002fextra\\u003e\",\"legendgroup\":\"\",\"marker\":{\"color\":\"#636efa\",\"pattern\":{\"shape\":\"\"}},\"name\":\"\",\"orientation\":\"v\",\"showlegend\":false,\"textposition\":\"auto\",\"x\":[\"Beni\",\"Chuquisaca\",\"Cochabamba\",\"La Paz\",\"Oruro\",\"Pando\",\"Potos\\u00ed\",\"Santa Cruz\",\"Tarija\"],\"xaxis\":\"x\",\"y\":{\"dtype\":\"f8\",\"bdata\":\"XY\\u002fC9Si8O0AaYbmnEfZAQKuqqqqq\\u002fkFALgEK1RKgP0BGMNHfyao6QHd3d3d3tzlA12iN1mjNPkBQB3VQB9FFQIM8JchT4kpA\"},\"yaxis\":\"y\",\"type\":\"bar\"}],                        {\"template\":{\"data\":{\"histogram2dcontour\":[{